        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion N-V3-BU, Skyline Square Grab Mortise Handleset with Nevada Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Skyline with Square Grab Handleset was made to grace Fifth Avenue; but even if you don't live in the big apple, this modern handleset is perfect to bring New York City glamour to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside. It features the Nevada Lever for a modern look. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion V3 Skyline Modern Front Door Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
