                "description": "The Skyline with Square Grab Handleset was made to grace Fifth Avenue; but even if you don't live in the big apple, this modern handleset is perfect to bring New York City glamour to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside. It features the Nevada Lever for a modern look. \r\n",
